        <briefdescription>
<para>A utility function for parsing an argument as a delimited list. To use, initialize a const char* pointer to the start of argument string. Then call <ref refid="namespaceargagg_1_1convert_1a2624aa278ddbcde5062f46f3f7d51401" kindref="member">parse_next_component()</ref>, providing that pointer, a mutable reference to where the parsed argument will go, and optionally the delimiting character. The argument string will be read up to the next delimiting character and then converted using <computeroutput>argagg::convert::arg&lt;decltype(out_arg)&gt;()</computeroutput>. The pointer is then incremented accordingly. If the delimiting character is no longer found then false is returned meaning that parsing the list can be considered finished. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;argagg/argagg.hpp&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">struct<sp/>position3<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>x;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>y;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>z;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">namespace<sp/>argagg<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">namespace<sp/>convert<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>template<sp/>&lt;&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>position3<sp/>arg(const<sp/>char*<sp/>s)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>position3<sp/>result<sp/>{0.0,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>0.0};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(!parse_next_component(s,<sp/>result.x))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>could<sp/>potentially<sp/>throw<sp/>an<sp/>error<sp/>if<sp/>you<sp/>require<sp/>that<sp/>at<sp/>least<sp/>two</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>components<sp/>exist<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(!parse_next_component(s,<sp/>result.y))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(!parse_next_component(s,<sp/>result.z))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>//<sp/>namespace<sp/>convert</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>//<sp/>namespace<sp/>argagg</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>argagg::parser<sp/>argparser<sp/>{{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{<sp/>&quot;origin&quot;,<sp/>{&quot;-o&quot;,<sp/>&quot;--origin&quot;},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&quot;origin<sp/>as<sp/>position3<sp/>specified<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>comma<sp/>separated<sp/>list<sp/>of<sp/>&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&quot;components<sp/>(e.g.<sp/>&apos;1,2,3&apos;)&quot;,<sp/>1},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>}};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>argagg::parser_results<sp/>args<sp/>=<sp/>argparser.parse(argc,<sp/>argv);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>auto<sp/>my_position<sp/>=<sp/>args[&quot;origin&quot;].as&lt;position3&gt;();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
